WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.057 --> 00:00:02.991
(whooshing)

00:00:02.991 --> 00:00:06.074
(upbeat Latin music)

00:00:09.711 --> 00:00:12.136
(engine revving)

00:00:12.136 --> 00:00:14.903
- All right Believe Nation,
we're in the car with the kids.

00:00:14.903 --> 00:00:17.442
There's a street that has
all sorts of Santa Clauses

00:00:17.442 --> 00:00:19.901
where everybody bought
the same Santa Claus

00:00:19.901 --> 00:00:21.475
from the same store.

00:00:21.475 --> 00:00:23.931
So we're going to film it as we drive by.

00:00:23.931 --> 00:00:25.014
We have Nina.

00:00:26.143 --> 00:00:26.982
We have Hayden.

00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:30.488
And we have his two cousins,
Jeffrey and Catherine.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:31.321
What's up guys?

00:00:31.321 --> 00:00:32.482
- Good!

00:00:32.482 --> 00:00:34.245
- You want to see some Santa Claus'?

00:00:34.245 --> 00:00:35.347
- Yeah!

00:00:35.347 --> 00:00:38.607
- Okay, let's go see some Santa Claus'.

00:00:38.607 --> 00:00:40.221
There's the first Santa Claus!

00:00:40.221 --> 00:00:41.758
- [Hayden] I summon the Santa Claus!

00:00:41.758 --> 00:00:42.803
There he is!

00:00:42.803 --> 00:00:44.779
- [Evan] Hello Santa!

00:00:44.779 --> 00:00:46.921
What's up, mister!

00:00:46.921 --> 00:00:47.846
That was a good one.

00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:49.927
Apparently one person
bought it one year and then

00:00:49.927 --> 00:00:52.264
all the neighbors decided
they would buy it too.

00:00:52.264 --> 00:00:53.957
So that's the start.

00:00:53.957 --> 00:00:55.537
Let's keep going.

00:00:55.537 --> 00:00:57.131
Oh, I see one!

00:00:57.131 --> 00:00:57.964
I see one!

00:00:59.512 --> 00:01:02.937
- There's Santa!
- Santa Claus, Santa Claus!

00:01:02.937 --> 00:01:05.016
There, look at all the Santa's!

00:01:05.016 --> 00:01:06.080
(kids laughing)

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.971
- [Evan] Ho Santa!

00:01:07.971 --> 00:01:09.769
It's a street full of Santa.

00:01:09.769 --> 00:01:11.380
- [Kids] Ah ha.

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.764
- I see more Santa Claus.

00:01:13.764 --> 00:01:15.176
What do you guys want to say?

00:01:15.176 --> 00:01:16.357
- [Kids] Ho Ho Ho!

00:01:16.357 --> 00:01:17.258
- [Evan] Ho Ho Ho!

00:01:17.258 --> 00:01:18.980
Here comes more Santa!

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:20.640
Here comes more Santa!

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:21.660
Look at that one!

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:23.391
He's waving from the corner.

00:01:23.391 --> 00:01:25.990
I think that last Santa
Claus was my favorite.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:27.241
What do you think guys?

00:01:27.241 --> 00:01:28.255
Oh, I see more!

00:01:28.255 --> 00:01:29.088
I see more!

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:30.924
How many have we seen so far?

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:31.929
Like three?

00:01:31.929 --> 00:01:32.915
- [Kids] No.

00:01:32.915 --> 00:01:34.656
- More than three or less?

00:01:34.656 --> 00:01:35.621
More than three?

00:01:35.621 --> 00:01:36.963
- Yeah.

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.787
- More Santa Claus.

00:01:38.787 --> 00:01:39.905
