00:01:39.905 --> 00:01:40.968
- Ten?

00:01:40.968 --> 00:01:42.271
- [Jeffrey] Well that's eleven.

00:01:42.271 --> 00:01:44.041
- [Evan] 11, I think it's more than that.

00:01:44.041 --> 00:01:45.550
Look at all these Santa Claus'.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:46.383
What do you think Nina?

00:01:46.383 --> 00:01:47.216
- Mmm hmm.

00:01:47.216 --> 00:01:49.415
- Nina's too busy focusing.

00:01:49.415 --> 00:01:50.830
Oh look at the shriveled up Santa!

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:53.068
You going to get the shriveled
up Santa Claus? Look!

00:01:53.068 --> 00:01:54.082
- [Nina] I can't see.

00:01:54.082 --> 00:01:55.658
- [Evan] Shriveled up Santa.

00:01:55.658 --> 00:01:57.451
Ah, he lost his air.

00:01:57.451 --> 00:01:59.236
That Santa Claus lost his air.

00:01:59.236 --> 00:02:00.183
Very sad.

00:02:00.183 --> 00:02:01.865
Let's keep going.

00:02:01.865 --> 00:02:03.686
Let's find some more Santas.

00:02:03.686 --> 00:02:05.392
Oh look at all the Santas that fell over.

00:02:05.392 --> 00:02:07.492
Poor Santa Claus.

00:02:07.492 --> 00:02:08.909
Poor Santa Claus.

00:02:11.256 --> 00:02:12.542
All right.

00:02:12.542 --> 00:02:14.439
We're almost done!

00:02:14.439 --> 00:02:16.357
(ragtime music)

00:02:16.357 --> 00:02:17.523
Welcome to Kringlewood.

00:02:17.523 --> 00:02:19.625
That sign said "Welcome to Kringlewood".

00:02:19.625 --> 00:02:21.187
This street is named Inglewood

00:02:21.187 --> 00:02:22.748
and so I guess they called it Kringlewood

00:02:22.748 --> 00:02:25.415
after Kris Kringle, Santa Claus.

00:02:26.767 --> 00:02:29.137
- [Catherine] Ah, the Santa Claus melt!

00:02:29.137 --> 00:02:30.183
- [Evan and Nina] It melted!

00:02:30.183 --> 00:02:34.257
- [Evan] Aw, that's the last Santa Claus.

00:02:34.257 --> 00:02:35.208
That's it.

00:02:35.208 --> 00:02:36.100
All right.

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:39.944
Well thank you guys for
joining us in Kringlewood.

00:02:39.944 --> 00:02:41.237
Okay what's your message guys?

00:02:41.237 --> 00:02:42.411
What do you want to say?

00:02:42.411 --> 00:02:43.611
- Ho Ho Ho Merry Christmas.

00:02:43.611 --> 00:02:45.259
- Nice, Merry Christmas.

00:02:45.259 --> 00:02:46.303
Thank you guys for watching.

00:02:46.303 --> 00:02:48.112
We believe in you!

00:02:48.112 --> 00:02:50.110
We hope you continue to...

00:02:50.110 --> 00:02:51.859
- [All] Believe!

00:02:51.859 --> 00:02:52.928
- In yourself!

00:02:52.928 --> 00:02:55.428
And whatever your one word is!

00:02:56.307 --> 00:02:57.638
Much love guys!

00:02:57.638 --> 00:02:58.471
I got to drive.

00:02:58.471 --> 00:02:59.304
We'll see you soon.

00:02:59.304 --> 00:03:01.323
Have a great 2017.

00:03:01.323 --> 00:03:03.549
(explosion)

